{"id":"13a5b3e71c6d5d19","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number.md","title":"ZFC CI Additivity Null Number","display":"df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number — ZFC CI Additivity Null Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number — ZFC CI Additivity Null Number","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-additivity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number — ZFC CI Additivity Null Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a88cbf5f6d98949d\" href=\"?note=a88cbf5f6d98949d\" title=\"58-df-additivity\">58-df-additivity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathcal N,X\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathcal N,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Additivity}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Additivity}_S\\)</span> (least witnessed additivity relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a88cbf5f6d98949d\" href=\"?note=a88cbf5f6d98949d\" title=\"58-df-additivity\">58-df-additivity</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityNullNumber}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityNullNumber}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}additivity\\text{-}null\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityNullNumber}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal N,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Additivity}_S(\\mathcal N,X,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}additivity\\text{-}null\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityNullNumber}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal N,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Additivity}_S(\\mathcal N,X,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Additivity}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Additivity}_S\\)</span> supplies both an escaping-union witness and cardinal minimality, so the definition does not apply an undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\">\\(\\min\\)</span> to an empty class.</li>\n<li>When <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> is the supplied null ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, this relation gives its additivity number while preserving the existing three-argument downstream interface.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-additivity","status":"resolved","id":"a88cbf5f6d98949d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-additivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-additivity","status":"resolved","id":"a88cbf5f6d98949d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Additivity}_S$ (least witnessed additivity relation, see [[58-df-additivity]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa,\\mathcal N,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Additivity}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityNullNumber}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}additivity\\text{-}null\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityNullNumber}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal N,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Additivity}_S(\\mathcal N,X,\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Additivity}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\min","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1178,"backlinks":[{"id":"1ecb3b4164c43d4b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6e4e3fc5e4e9e2ce","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1597","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number.md|58-df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a88cbf5f6d98949d"]}